      {
        "id": 97043,
        "authorName": "کامران تلطف",
        "authorUrl": null,
        "commentDate": "2022-05-08T20:26:44.402089",
        "htmlComment": "<p>در شعر دوم \"چه بر خورند\" دارای ابهام است اما میتوان آنرا به \"چرا توانایی ندارند\" معنی کرد.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">O Beloved, what kind of heart would not fall in love with you</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Because in your beauty I saw the perfect creation of God</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Why they could not bear the delicacy of your stature, I do not know</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">All the people together, they could not withstand this calamity</p>",
        "publishStatus": "",
        "inReplyToId": null,
